{
  "schema_version": "prompt-runtime.program-scenario.v1",
  "story_path": "user_stories/autopilot-launcher-ports.md",
  "criteria": [
    {
      "id": "AC1",
      "text": "`autopilotLaunchFingerprint` reads `package.json` via `files.read`, hashes the canonical launch payload via `compute.hash_utf8`, and throws `Error` when the coordinator state is invalid."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC2",
      "text": "`withAutopilotModeLock` verifies the Git root via `exec.execFile`, claims admission via `lock.claimAdmission`, runs `modeAction.run`, updates `controlRevision` via `process.uuid` and `files.write` when the state file exists, and throws `Error` when `cwd` is empty."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC3",
      "text": "`requestAutopilotCompletion` and `tickAutopilot` inspect saved launcher state via `files.read`, claim and release tick locks via `lock.claimTick` and `lock.releaseTick`, reconcile settings and issues when enabled, and throw `Error` on invalid paths."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC4",
      "text": "`runAutopilotLauncher` executes `stop`, `add`, and `status --all` through `exec.execFile`, `files`, `fs`, `lock`, `timer`, and `herdr`, refuses invalid arguments with exitCode 2, and throws `Error` when `command` is empty."
    }
  ],
